    <header class="top">
      <div class="crumb"><span class="jd">48.04</span><span>Cultivation &amp; Strategy</span><span class="sep">/</span><b>Marguerite &amp; Paul Rennick</b></div>
      <div class="search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m16.5 16.5 4 4"/></svg><span>Search everything</span><span class="k">⌘K</span></div>
      <div class="tacts">
        <button class="btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6z"/><path d="M9 13h7M9 17h4"/></svg>Export PDF</button>
        <button class="btn p"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>Log a gift</button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="phead">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Contact · household</p>
          <h1>Marguerite &amp; Paul Rennick</h1>
          <p class="lede">Giving since 2014-03-11 · advises the Rennick Family Fund at a donor-advised sponsor · Catalyst Partners circle</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sp"></div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5A6E7A;margin-bottom:4px">Credit basis</div>
          <div class="seg">
            <button class="{{bHard}}" onClick="{{setHard}}">hard</button>
            <button class="{{bSoft}}" onClick="{{setSoft}}">soft_inclusive</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="note" style="margin-bottom:14px">{{basisNote}}</div>

      <div class="row" style="align-items:flex-start">
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Giving history</h2><div class="r"><span class="b {{basisTone}}">basis: {{basis}}</span><button class="btn sm q">CSV</button></div></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:flex-end;padding:16px 14px 8px">
              <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Lifetime</span><span class="v">{{lifetime}}</span><span class="d">{{lifetimeD}}</span></div>
              <div class="kpi"><span class="l">FY2026</span><span class="v">{{fy}}</span><span class="d">{{fyD}}</span></div>
              <div class="kpi"><span class="l">Largest gift</span><span class="v">{{largest}}</span><span class="d">{{largestD}}</span></div>
              <div class="sp"></div>
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:5px;height:64px">
                <sc-for list="{{bars}}" as="b" hint-placeholder-count="6">
                  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px">
                    <div style="width:26px;height:{{b.h}};background:{{b.color}};border-radius:3px 3px 0 0"></div>
                    <span style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#5A6E7A">{{b.y}}</span>
                  </div>
                </sc-for>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cbd flush">
              <table class="tbl">
                <thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Gift</th><th>Credit</th><th>Fund</th><th class="num">Amount</th><th>Receipt</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <sc-for list="{{gifts}}" as="g" hint-placeholder-count="6">
                    <tr class="hov">
                      <td class="mono">{{g.date}}</td>
                      <td><div style="font-weight:700">{{g.source}}</div><div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">{{g.note}}</div></td>
                      <td><span class="b {{g.tone}}">{{g.kind}}</span><div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700">{{g.reason}}</div></td>
                      <td>{{g.fund}}</td>
                      <td class="num" style="font-weight:{{g.weight}}">{{g.amt}}</td>
                      <td><span class="b {{g.rcTone}}">{{g.receipt}}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                  </sc-for>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="prov">
              <span>Soft credits have zero ledger effect</span><span>·</span>
              <span>hard-credit total ties to contributed revenue to the cent</span><span>·</span>
              <span class="mono">gift_credits · credit_basis={{basis}}</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Why the two totals differ</h2><div class="r"><span class="sub">a $10,000 DAF gift can soft-credit two people for $10,000 each — neither is revenue</span></div></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;gap:14px">
              <div style="flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px">
                <h3 style="color:#014263">hard — financial truth</h3>
                <p style="margin:5px 0 0;color:#3A4A53;font-size:12.5px">Exactly one hard credit per gift: the legal donor, the only party who receives the substantiation letter. Sums equal the general ledger.</p>
              </div>
              <div style="flex:1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px">
                <h3 style="color:#C97F14">soft_inclusive — relationship truth</h3>
                <p style="margin:5px 0 0;color:#3A4A53;font-size:12.5px">What a development officer needs to see. Totals summed across donors deliberately exceed contributed revenue, and every view carrying them says so on its face.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="width:326px;flex:0 0 326px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Relationships</h2><div class="r"><span class="b n">drives suggested soft credits</span></div></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0">
              <sc-for list="{{rels}}" as="r" hint-placeholder-count="4">
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #F1F5F8">
                  <span class="b {{r.tone}}">{{r.kind}}</span>
                  <div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px">{{r.name}}</div><div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11px;font-weight:600">{{r.note}}</div></div>
                </div>
              </sc-for>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Suggested soft credit</h2><div class="r"><span class="b k">awaiting a human</span></div></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
              <sc-if value="{{suggestOpen}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ true }}">
                <div style="font-size:12.5px;color:#3A4A53">A $25,000 gift arrived 2026-08-14 from <b>Rennick Family Fund</b> at a DAF sponsor. The advisor on file for that fund is Marguerite Rennick.</div>
                <div style="display:flex;gap:7px">
                  <button class="btn sm p" onClick="{{acceptSug}}">Add soft credit</button>
                  <button class="btn sm" onClick="{{dismissSug}}">Not this one</button>
                </div>
              </sc-if>
              <sc-if value="{{suggestDone}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
                <div class="b g" style="align-self:flex-start">{{sugResult}}</div>
                <div style="color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600">Recorded with who decided and when. The ledger did not move.</div>
              </sc-if>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="chd"><h2>Acknowledgments</h2></div>
            <div class="cbd" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px">
              <div style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start">
                <span class="b i" style="height:17px">hard</span>
                <div style="font-size:12px;color:#3A4A53">Tax receipt with Pub 1771 substantiation language — sent to the legal donor only.</div>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start">
                <span class="b k" style="height:17px">soft</span>
                <div style="font-size:12px;color:#3A4A53">Thank-you variant with <b>no tax language</b>. The deduction belongs to the legal donor, and the template cannot include it.</div>
              </div>
              <div style="border-top:1px solid #F1F5F8;padding-top:9px;color:#5A6E7A;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600">Last sent 2026-08-15 · queued by the gift webhook, approved by fund development.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
